    "agent1-periodic-width-projection": {
      "status": "PASS",
      "scope": "The compositional eight-residue lift of the original 878-node/1458-labelled-edge outside/phase catalog has 7024 distinct nodes and 11664 labelled edge-list entries. Every actual valid catalog-supported maximal period-four quotient projects to an edge preserving actual terminal carry and exceptional all-nine labels, with width residue advanced by that carry. Separately, finite literal quotient paths telescope signed interface width; equal endpoint interface widths force overflow count divisible by eight and total signed increment equal to overflow count divided by eight. No temporal-period divisibility, positive clock count, saved traversal order, reachability/SCC equality, arbitrary abstract path realization, guarded all-time exponent trajectory, safety closure, finite-interface return existence or 196 conclusion. Original Canonical input digits identify decimal-length residue for every copy count; with positive copy count and the complete original column-sum realization, the actual ordinary successor decimal-length residue equals that of the quotient interface. This does not assert the small-copy-count whole-word quotient formula.",
